   "source": [
    "Python is a high-level, interpreted, object-oriented, and general-purpose programming language. It is simple, readable, and widely used in Data Science, Machine Learning, Artificial Intelligence, Web Development, Automation, and many other domains.\n",
    "\n",
    "- It is designed to be easy to read and write.\n",
    "- It is one of the most popular language because of its simple syntax and wide range of aapplications.\n",
    "\n",
    "# Python extention - .py\n",
    "# Jupyter Notebook extension - .ipynb\n",
    "# .ipynb (interactive python notebook)"
   ]
  },
